Three tracked data sets originate outside this project.

1. src/text/unicode_tables.hpp

   Generated by tools/gen_unicode_tables.py from the Unicode Character
   Database as exposed by Python's unicodedata module (Unicode 15.0.0). The
   file contains codepoint range tables derived from that data.

